    "statement": "At the official first degree, every heavy row x that is a root of the parameter-constant residual obeys c_x+epsilon_x-t_x=0 mod 3, where c_x is its row deficit, t_x counts distinguished excess roots outside the squarefree minimal locator, and epsilon_x is excess multiplicity beyond one copy per distinguished incidence. Thus full-overlap deficits 0,1,2 mod 3 require at least 0,2,1 correction copies, and the global regular-rank budget gains the sum of these row corrections.",
